re Farmers Market runs Saturdays from May through the first week in December in the municipal lot at Park and Dartmouth avenues.","source_url":"https://www.swarthmorepa.org/873/Residents","source_title":"Residents | Borough of Swarthmore","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Seasonal schedule stated by the Borough: Saturdays, 9:30 a.m. to 1:30 p.m., May through the first week of December.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"centennial-park","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Centennial Park","title":"Pause in downtown green space","subtitle":"Rutgers Avenue corridor — downtown Swarthmore","notes":"Follow the downtown Rutgers Avenue corridor to Centennial Park, take a seat on a bench, and continue toward nearby town-center destinations afterward.","short_summary":"A small borough park created for Swarthmore’s centennial.","evidence_claim":"The Borough says Centennial Park was created in 1993 to mark the Borough’s Centennial and is located in downtown Swarthmore.","source_url":"https://www.swarthmorepa.org/2165/Parks","source_title":"Parks | Borough of Swarthmore","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Follow posted park rules and any temporary Borough notices.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"little-crum-creek-park","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Little Crum Creek Park","title":"Walk to the restored wetlands","subtitle":"Yale Avenue corridor — enter from Yale or Cresson avenues","notes":"Use the Yale Avenue corridor to enter the park, stay on appropriate paths, and look for the restored wetlands along Little Crum Creek.","short_summary":"A large borough park with creekside habitat and restored wetlands.","evidence_claim":"The Borough identifies L